      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-5",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I. Welcome & Objectives"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Dream Funded: From Concept to Capital accelerator + crowdfunding integration**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-8",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-7",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Purpose of meeting**"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-9",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Align Engineer and User’s development process with the accelerator curriculum"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-10",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Confirm intake and application workflow"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-11",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Map out an 8–10 week timeline for cohort delivery"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
