        },
        {
          "id": "b-23",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Discuss alignment with the technical build process:**"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-25",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Week 1:** Intake/orientation → Engineer intake + Vision Brief"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-26",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Week 2–3:** Business model + product design → CAD/mockups + MVP wireframes"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-27",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Week 4–5:** Marketing/storytelling + prototype builds → aligns with campaign prep"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-28",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Week 6:** Financial readiness + group prototype review → donor-ready narrative"
        }
