    },
    {
      "id": "b-29",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Week 7–8:** Crowdfunding launch prep + refined MVP/prototype → media toolkit integration"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-30",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Week 9–10:** Campaign live + Gala pitch prep → joint engineer + business coaching touchpoints"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-32",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
